JUSTIFICATION

I have chosen to follow through this project using the MIT license, my justification for doing so is MIT is a short and permissive open source liscense, allowing permissions for anyone to view, edit or distribute this project allowing for easier hand-ins and peer overview. Additionally, every limitation of the license does not impact my work and/or ability for grading as the main agrument against MIT is its limitation around warranties and trademarks/patents, as it does not requirement to license my own work, this can be very detremental to professional studios but as i have no intention to provide a warranty or trademark to my work it does not impact my abilities in the project. Furthermore, MIT allows combinit MIT code with propeiratry code, which may prove useful throughout the development of this project.
